==English==
===Etymology===
From [[Ancient Greek]] prefix [[παλαιο-]] "[[paleo-]]", from [[παλαιός]] (''palaios'') "old". 
===Alternative spellings===
*[[pale-]]
*[[palaeo-]]
*[[palae-]]

